Comments don't hide syntax: a test block whose title follows a comment is listed, and a member keeps its decorators in its line range when a comment sits between them.
== args
input/commented.test.ts
== file input/commented.test.ts
class Cache {
  @memo
  // Expensive.
  load() {}
}
test(/* slow */ "loads", () => {});
== stdout
input/commented.test.ts
